                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.51/3603: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Schurman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-11-30T20:00:00+08:00"><hi rendition="#italic">November 30,
                                1921—8 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received November 30—12:11
                        p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>426. Pacific Development loan extended three months, interest to date paid
                    today.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Schurman</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
